{"title":"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 29","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/5/8c54621781e7935bc3674d8040c58760c0b7a785.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=1, 2, \\cdots, 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"121\" height=\"16\" /> let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/5/4250990db8d1c29a054b4016df2b1ee90f898268.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" /> be the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> terms of the arithmetic progression whose first term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and whose common difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/3/5b323ad7fbc11d8a8098e0cddf96f26c166e355b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2p-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />; then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/4/2c406e74e702ef7c1cc05b45723609eca8c5c381.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1+S_2+\\cdots+S_{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"148\" height=\"15\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/7/077fc9958ee6917852aa2901f951049136b34689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } 80000 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }80200 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } 80400 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } 80600 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }80800$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"523\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/4/3b466d37e71a95108ec8b22ae6177c7b270ad1b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40\\text{th}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" /> term of an arithmetic progression with a first term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and a common difference <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/3/5b323ad7fbc11d8a8098e0cddf96f26c166e355b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2p-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8d806d3c6afe77bf987b969b531ce87c1ba3897.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+39(2p-1)=79p-39$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"205\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> terms of such a progression is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/2/5d2a67a51bdcadd07a335625c18d0f72af77b4d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{40}{2}(79p-39+p)=1600p-780$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"254\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>We now want to evaluate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/1/ff11f6ac957f33a18800466b29d36bc51b6c88e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{p=1}^{10}(1600p-780)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"133\" height=\"52\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/6/9f62acd412c822c6caf5f9f07ca281051bd9badd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{p=1}^{10}(1600p-780)=1600\\sum_{p=1}^{10}(p)-\\sum_{p=1}^{10}(780)\\]\" width=\"334\" height=\"52\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/9/919b65da8dfd8dea96fa0c786e11d6f36ff74ec4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=(1600)\\left(\\frac{10\\cdot11}{2}\\right)-(780)(10)=88000-7800=80200, \\boxed{\\text{B}}.\\]\" width=\"477\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME\" title=\"1974 AHSME\">1974 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1974 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1974\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">Problem 30</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.